A thing I like to do just before converting an early altar is praying
for _unholy_ water, unless I already have some.  Can be a good thing to
have, and should certainly be done before acquiring protection and
maxing out luck.  The consequences at that point aren't worse than those
for failing to convert the altar, and conversion doesn't depend on your
god's anger.  Afterwards, use the converted altar to remedy things and
to produce holy water.

Do check your alignment before starting, so as not to convert yourself
instead of the altar…  And always stash unholy water before using altars
/ praying, or it might be gone quickly.

